The workflow chain is now:

/speckit.constitution — establish principles
/speckit.specify — define requirements
/speckit.plan — technical plan
/speckit.tasks — task breakdown
/speckit.taskstoissues — push to GitHub Issues (built-in)
/speckit.implementfromissues — iterative issue-driven implementation (custom)


